─────────────────────────────────
⏱️ *Tenor:* ${activeTenorObj.months} Bulan ${activeTenorObj.cut > 0 ? `(Gratis ${activeTenorObj.cut} Bln / Cukup ${activeTenorObj.pay}x Bayar)` : `(${activeTenorObj.pay}x Bayar)`}
💸 *Diskon Angsuran:* ${currentDiscountPerMonth > 0 ? `-${formatRupiah(currentDiscountPerMonth)} / bln` : 'Tidak Ada'}
